          SEG

          MOVE W I 500, R0
          MOVE W I 600, R1
          MOVE W I H'12345678', R2

          MOVE W R2, !R0
          MOVE W !R0, R3

          MOVE W I H'AABBCCDD', R4
          MOVE W R4, 4+!R0
          MOVE W 4+!R0, R5

          MOVE W I 504, !R1
          MOVE W !!R1, R6

          HALT
          END
